  "name": "AP – E2E QuickBooks clean-up",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note-e2e-quickbooks-clean-up",
      "name": "Note: E2E QuickBooks clean-up",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "content": "## E2E QuickBooks clean-up\nDeletes the QuickBooks bills and attached PDFs created by the **daily end-to-end test**, so the books stay clean. Called by *AP – Daily e2e test* before and after each run.\n\nThe **core decides** what may be deleted: only an object it recorded for a test invoice, read back with the test vendor, an **E2E-** number and the test invoice named in its note. Anything else is kept, logged, and the test fails until a person looks.",
        "height": 350,
        "width": 1380
      },
      "position": [
        -40,
        -150
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-list",
      "name": "Note: List",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## List\nThe core lists the test's objects not deleted yet (attachments before bills).",
        "height": 350,
        "width": 900
      },
      "position": [
        -40,
        250
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-check,-then-delete",
      "name": "Note: Check, then delete",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "content": "## Check, then delete\nEach object is read back from QuickBooks; the core checks it and writes the delete request. QuickBooks' answer goes back to the core.",
        "height": 550,
        "width": 660
      },
      "position": [
        920,
        250
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "note-no-list",
      "name": "Note: No list",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 3,
        "content": "## No list\nThe core did not answer: the run fails (logged by the error workflow); the test's reset then refuses to delete anything.",
        "height": 350,
        "width": 420
      },
      "position": [
        440,
        650
      ],
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "called-by-the-e2e-test",
